### **Summary Table**

| Enforcement Site | File | Lines | Method | Visibility Check |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Memo Read Access | memo_service.go | 39-68 | `checkMemoReadAccess()` | Private/Protected/Archived |
| List Memos | memo_service.go | 178-227 | `ListMemos()` | Filter by visibility list |
| Reactions List | reaction_service.go | 15-58 | `ListMemoReactions()` | Private check |
| Create Reaction | reaction_service.go | 60-109 | `UpsertMemoReaction()` | Private check |
| Create Comment | memo_service_comments.go | 20-43 | `CreateMemoComment()` | Private check |
| List Comments | memo_service_comments.go | 136-150 | `ListMemoComments()` | checkMemoReadAccess |
| List Attachments | memo_attachment_service.go | 200-241 | `ListMemoAttachments()` | Private check |
| Attachment Access | attachment_service.go | 419-455 | `checkAttachmentAccess()` | Linked memo visibility |
| Share Create/Delete | memo_share_service.go | 21-208 | Multiple share functions | Creator/admin only |
| Shared Memo Access | memo_share_service.go | 151-192 | `GetMemoByShare()` | Share token + expiry |
| File Download | fileserver.go | 649-704 | `checkAttachmentPermission()` | Private + share fallback |
| Relations List | memo_relation_service.go | 93-147 | `ListMemoRelations()` | Filter by visibility |
| Notifications | user_service_notifications.go | 302-316 | `canViewerAccessMemo()` | Private/Protected check |

All enforcement uses the same core visibility model: **PUBLIC** (anyone), **PROTECTED** (authenticated users), or **PRIVATE** (creator only), with admin/super-user bypass available throughout.
